# Argos documentation lifecycle

Before substantive work, read:

1. `docs/roadmap.md`
2. `docs/execution-plan.md`
3. `status.md` of the active epic under `docs/epics/`

Rules:

- Do not write product code without an epic marked `in_progress`
- After every meaningful progress, update **both** `docs/roadmap.md` and `docs/execution-plan.md`
- Completed epics must move from `docs/epics/<name>/` to `docs/done/<name>/`
- Prefer English-only docs (see `argos-english-only.mdc`)
